I wanted to talk to you about, maro.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:18.603
Chapter One of the Extra Seven made
Shu's Blue Dragon stronger, maro.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:33.030
And Chapter Two of the Extra Seven
made Jiro's Minotaur stronger, maro.

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.903
Sky Terror!

00:02:41.266 --> 00:02:44.866
It's your turn next, maro.

00:02:45.066 --> 00:02:46.766
I hope so.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.230
Let's pray together so
that'll happen, maro.

00:02:50.766 --> 00:02:51.826
Understood.

00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:54.833
Please give Saber Tiger more power...

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:56.233
Yes, please.

00:02:56.733 --> 00:02:59.973
