could they be saying?

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.403
The soldier defending the east...

00:03:07.933 --> 00:03:12.503
gathers all of the spirits and
brings moisture to this land.

00:03:12.633 --> 00:03:13.703
Maro?

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:19.330
