concerning the Extra Seven.

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:35.326
What?!

00:04:41.133 --> 00:04:43.573
Pa!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.730
Ma!

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:49.130
