00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.700
I'm not lying, pa.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.730
Do these look like lying eyes, pa?

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.930
Do they, pa?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.730
Yeah, they look like lying eyes, ma!

00:05:12.766 --> 00:05:14.196
Pa!

00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:19.466
