00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:53.130
I was chasing after a girl's underwear
in the neighboring village and...

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.870
Maro.

00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:01.503
I ended up getting lost, maro.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.930
And here I am,
back home today, maro.

00:06:04.633 --> 00:06:06.103
Here you show up for
the first time in six months,

00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:07.133
