a great Shadow Wielder, maro!

00:06:34.233 --> 00:06:35.433
Marumaro!

00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:40.333
- Pa?
- Ma?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:44.230
They're my friends who helped me out
when I was lost, maro.

00:06:44.966 --> 00:06:46.726
