but please have some, ma.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.030
Please, help yourself, pa.
Please, pa.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.600
Zola.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.870
What's the next sentence, maro?

00:07:18.533 --> 00:07:19.533
