00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.600
The part after the soldier
defending the east, maro.

00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:27.796
Gathers all of the spirits and
brings moisture to this land.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:35.170
Gathers all of the spirits and
brings moisture to this land, maro.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.170
Gathers all of the spirits...

00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:47.833
