Did you have to draw that on me?

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.870
Maro.

00:18:08.333 --> 00:18:09.403
Marumaro!

00:18:13.433 --> 00:18:15.673
I won't let you through, Marumaro!

00:18:20.366 --> 00:18:21.826
He's heading for the canyon!

00:18:22.333 --> 00:18:25.073
Alright! Run though the canyon like that!

00:18:25.433 --> 00:18:27.073
Maro!

00:18:38.433 --> 00:18:39.533
Maro!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:47.470
So those are...

00:18:47.533 --> 00:18:48.973
