00:19:10.033 --> 00:19:14.103
It might be impossible to
overcome this challenge

00:19:14.133 --> 00:19:17.733
without displaying power
beyond Saber Tiger's limits.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.600
What in the worldâ€”?!

00:19:23.066 --> 00:19:25.566
I won't stop, no matter what, maro!

00:19:25.666 --> 00:19:26.796
Roger!

00:19:42.166 --> 00:19:42.826
Wow.

