00:20:12.466 --> 00:20:16.726
We're not stopping, no matter what.
You're the one who said that, right?

00:20:19.766 --> 00:20:22.926
Let's go, maro! Saber Tiger!

00:20:22.966 --> 00:20:23.996
Roger!

00:20:30.466 --> 00:20:31.466
Marumaro!

00:20:53.766 --> 00:20:55.226
Maro!

