00:21:06.066 --> 00:21:07.996
Do you really have to go, ma?

00:21:08.333 --> 00:21:11.133
I'm a defender of justice, maro.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.970
We're going to miss you, pa.

00:21:13.466 --> 00:21:17.226
Don't worry, maro.
I'll be back one day, maro.

00:21:19.466 --> 00:21:21.426
Well, it's time to go, maro.

00:21:23.866 --> 00:21:24.866
Is it okay?

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:26.270
Is what okay, maro?

00:21:26.633 --> 00:21:31.103
You were lost, right?
Here you've finally got home, so...

00:21:31.533 --> 00:21:36.403
It's okay, maro.
I'm lost but I fight for justice, maro.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.830
We still haven't taken out
the bad guys, maro.

00:21:40.166 --> 00:21:40.826
Right!

00:21:41.466 --> 00:21:43.466
Hold it!

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:46.300
Look at my bloomers, too!

00:21:46.333 --> 00:21:48.873
T-There's just no way, maro!

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:51.770
Wait!

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:53.700
I'm not waiting, maro!

00:21:53.733 --> 00:21:55.303
Here! Here!

00:21:55.333 --> 00:21:58.173
Miss, I'd be glad to take his place.

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:00.970
You perverted old man!

00:22:07.933 --> 00:22:09.873
Why are you going yourself,
General Logi?

00:22:09.966 --> 00:22:11.196
I have no choice.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:14.530
Delphinium is on
an intelligence mission, so...

00:22:14.666 --> 00:22:16.266
Then we shall go with you.

00:22:16.733 --> 00:22:20.733
No, I have something
I need you guys to do for me.

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.530
General Logi,
are we to look after this place?

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:25.700
If so, that is rather boring.

00:22:26.066 --> 00:22:28.296
Don't be disheartened, Andropov.

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:32.070
The time will come when I'll have you
work to your heart's content.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.270
And it'll happen in the near future.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:37.570
So be prepared for that.

00:22:37.733 --> 00:22:38.403
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:24:17.933 --> 00:24:19.873
Shu and the others are
heading for Bouquet's ruins.

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:22.000
Gilliam who was supposed to
be dead appears before them.

00:24:22.033 --> 00:24:25.333
Did you get something in exchange
for letting him get away, Marumaro?

00:24:25.600 --> 00:24:28.400
What's this?
This is a photo of me taking a bath?!

00:24:28.433 --> 00:24:31.173
I took that the other day myself, maro!

00:24:31.300 --> 00:24:34.030
Next on Blue Dragon:
Gilliam Returns

00:24:34.233 --> 00:24:35.473
I'll kick your butt!

00:24:35.566 --> 00:24:36.566
Maro...
